s flash controller Yes Yes Yes Battery life (CIPA rating) 800 shots 950 shots 610 shots Dimensions (inches, WHD) 5.8x4.4x2.9 5.8x4.5x2.9 5.6x4.6x2.9 Body operating weight (ounces) 35 34.2 31.6 Mfr. Price (body only) $1,699 $1,799.95 $1,399.99"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":221,"row":{"pair_id":"14409093#17129419","label":0,"id_left":14409093,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":1343577,"brand_left":"\"GoPro\"@en","title_left":" \"GoPro Head Strap + QuickClip Mount\"@en Mount ACHOM-001 - Filmtools\"@en","description_left":"\"\nHead Strap is fully adjustable to fit all sizes\nCan be worn over a helmet or directly on your head in a headlamp-like position\nQuickClip allows you to attach your GoPro to a 3mm to 10mm thick object\nEnables ultra-compact, low-profile mounting\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17129419,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":15650048,"brand_right":"\"GoPro\"@en-US","title_right":" \"GoPro Side Mount (GoPro Official Mount)\"@en-US \"Camcorders | EISF\"@en-US","description_right":"\"Mount your GoPro to the side of helmets, vehicles, gear and more. 3-way adjustability makes aiming the camera easy.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":222,"row":{"pair_id":"11537002#16067015","label":0,"id_left":11537002,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":1751709,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Canon EOS 6D (Body) \"@en \" Canon | Digital SLR Camera Cameras Toronto Canada Store Aden","description_left":"\"\n                        For inquiries please call 416-977-9711 or email us at info@adencamera.com.\nThe Canon EOS 6D Digital Camera is a full-frame 20.2MP DSLR offering exceptionally high image quality and detail while providing compatibility and convenience through its design and features. When paired with the powerful DIGIC 5+ image processor and 14-bit A/D conversion, the full-frame sensor is capable of recording vivid imagery with expanded sensitivity up to ISO 102400. The processing power also affords intelligent noise reduction techniques and the ability to record continuous still images at a rate up to 4.5 full resolution fps.Main Features: \n\n20.2MP Full-Frame CMOS Sensor\n3.0\" Clear View High Resolution LCD\nDIGIC 5+ Image Processor\nBuilt-In Wi-Fi and GPS Connectivity\nFull HD 1080p with Manual Controls\n11-Point AF with Center Cross-Type Point\n63-Zone Dual Layer Metering Sensor\nExtended ISO Range of 50-102400\nUp to 4.5 Full Resolution FPS\nBuilt-In HDR and Multiple Exposure Modes\nUnit Dimensions: 5.7 x 4.4 x 2.8\" / 14.5 x 11.2 x 7.1cm\nUnit Weight: 27.16 oz / 770g\n\n\n1 Year Canon Canada & US Warranty\nAuthorized Canon Canada Pro Dealer\n                    \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Manufacturer: Canon Sku #: 8035B003_Bundle Our Price: $1,799.00 Ends 11/23/2017 Save: $200.00 MSRP: $1,999.00 Quantity:   Availability: In Stock FREE SHIPPING WITHIN CANADA!","id_right":16067015,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":59478,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Canon Speedlite 270EX II\"@en \" Canon II | Digital SLR Camera Toronto Canada Store Cameras Aden \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                        Worthy successor to the venerable Canon 270EX Speedlite, the new, ultra-lightweight Canon 270EX II Speedlite is a compact, high-performance flash unit designed for the evolving EOS enthusiast. Developed for fun and easy flash shooting, when used with select Canon EOS DSLR cameras that have a master function, the Speedlite 270EX II can be used as a versatile wireless slave flash. This Speedlite can also be used with other compact digital camera models equipped with a dedicated flash shoe mount. User-friendly in both function and design, the 270EX II Speedlite flash's Tele/Wide function easily and elegantly allows adjustment of illumination angle and guide number to match shooting conditions. On your photographic journey, the Canon 270EX II Speedlite is primed to be there at every step.\n\n\n\n1 Year Canon Canada and USA Warranty\n\n\n                    \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":223,"row":{"pair_id":"12339683#4749029","label":1,"id_left":12339683,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":526097,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Canon EOS 70D (no lens included)\"@en \" Canon included) 20-megapixel digital SLR camera with Dual Pixel CMOS autofocus and Wi-Fi® at Crutchfield.com \"@en","description_left":"\"20-megapixel digital SLR camera with Dual Pixel CMOS autofocus and Wi-Fi®\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":4749029,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":526097,"brand_right":"\"Canon\"@en-US","title_right":" \"Canon EOS 70D Digital SLR Camera (Body Only)\"@en-US \"Digital Cameras - Page 3 | EISF\"@en-US","description_right":"\"The Canon 8469B002 EOS 70D 20.2MP Digital Camera Body Only (lens sold separately) features an APS-C CMOS sensor and DIGIC 5+ image processor to ensure high-resolution images and excellent low-light sensitivity. Both the sensor and processor work together to produce well-detailed, clear imagery that exhibits natural tonality and color gradations with minimal noise when working in difficult lighting conditions. The processor also provides notable speed throughout the camera system, including the ability to record up to 7 fps in full-resolution, quickened AF speeds, and full HD 1080p video recording. The 3.0-inch Clear View II touchscreen LCD monitor profits greatly from the advent Dual Pixel CMOS AF system and its ability to utilize Touch AF focusing for finely controlled selection of the point of focus. The monitor's vari-angle design also enables more efficient shooting and viewing from both high and low angles and an anti-reflective, smudge-resistant coating allows for clear well-detailed viewing. In addition, the camera is compatible with Canon STM lenses for smooth, quiet AF performance.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":224,"row":{"pair_id":"15702626#12815556","label":0,"id_left":15702626,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":115701,"brand_left":"\"Transcend\"","title_left":" \"Transcend 32GB SDHC Class 10 Flash Memory Card Up to 30MB/s (TS32GSDHC10)\" \"Camera & Photo Accessories - Page 3 | All Tech Toys\"","description_left":"\"As high-tech gadgets become increasingly advanced with ever-improving video and audio quality, Transcend find themselves needing extra speed and memory capacity to store the high-resolution digital masterpieces.Adhering to the Class 10 specification, Transcend's SDHC cards perform at a transfer rate up to 20 MB/s on devices supporting SD 3.0, ensuring your device remains quick and responsive while recording and viewing files.The SDHC Class 10 series offer larger-volume data storage and optimized recording performance with support for FAT 32 file formats. With massive capacity storage, you can store your entire music or picture collection on today's high-megapixel digital cameras, HDTV digital video cameras, PDAs and other memory-hungry devices\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12815556,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":767046,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Transcend Ultimate - flash memory card 4 GB SDHC\" \" Transcend SDHC TS4GSDHC10 Flash Memory Cards CDW.com","description_right":"\"Featuring data transfer speeds of up to 30MB/s, Transcend's Class 10 SDXC/SDHC cards provide an impressive level of performance for high-megapixel digital cameras and Full-HD camcorders. With impressive write speed, these cards provide enhanced camera response for high-speed consecutive shooting as well as smooth Full HD video recording.\" ","price_right":"\"$\", \"8.99\"","specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":225,"row":{"pair_id":"12367618#17557266","label":0,"id_left":12367618,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":380140,"brand_left":"\"Logitech \"","title_left":" \"Logitech C525 (8MP) HD Webcam\" Webcam - 960-001064 | CCL Computers\"","description_left":"\"\n\n                                HD 720p video callsEnjoy widescreen HD video (720p) on most major IMs that support HD video calls.Get closer with autofocusYou’ll enjoy razor-sharp video calls even in extreme close-ups (up to 7 cm).Goes where you goSlip it in your bag, purse, even your pocket—with its fold-and-go design, this webcam goes wherever you go.\n\n                            \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557266,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":252724,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Full HD Outdoor Vandal Proof PoE Dome Camera\"@en \"DCS-4602EV Full Camera | D-Link UK\"@en","description_right":"\"\n              The Vigilance Full HD Outdoor Vandal-Proof PoE Dome Camera is a professional, full featured HD camera designed for use in harsh environments with industry-certified IK10 (vandal-proof) dome and IP66 (weather-proof) housing, as well as WDR, 3DNR and 20m night vision support.\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDownload the datasheet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n              \n\t\t\t\t \n\t                        List Retailers\n\t                        \n\t\t\t\t      \n              \n            \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Version Description Date 1.05.00 Release notes included 01/03/2017 Download 1.04.02 Release notes included 02/03/2016 Download 1.02.02 Release notes included 21/10/2015 Download 1.03.00 Release notes included 21/10/2015 Download"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":226,"row":{"pair_id":"11216286#15265349","label":1,"id_left":11216286,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":709331,"brand_left":"\"Canon\"@en","title_left":" \"EF 20mm f/2.8 USM\"@