ive transfer rates and vast storage space, Transcend's memory cards are the ideal complement to today's digital cameras and Full HD video camcorders.\" ","price_right":"\"$\", \"89.99\"","specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":258,"row":{"pair_id":"5832145#7585770","label":1,"id_left":5832145,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":197207,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Canon EOS 6D Kit\"@en and a 24-105mm f/4L lens at Crutchfield.com \"@en GPS \" Canon Kit 20.2-megapixel full-frame digital SLR camera with Wi-Fi®","description_left":"\"20.2-megapixel full-frame digital SLR camera with Wi-Fi®, GPS, and a 24-105mm f/4L lens\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Image Quality Aspect Ratio 3:2 4:3 16:9 1:1 Large/ Large (RAW) 5472 x 3648 (20.0MP) 4864 x 3648 (17.7MP) 5472 x 3072 (16.8MP) 3648 x 3648 (13.3MP) Medium (RAW) 4104 x 2736 (11.0MP) 3648 x 2736 (10.0MP) 4104 x 2310 (9.5MP) 2736 x 2736 (7.5MP) Medium 3648 x 2432 (8.9MP) 3248 x 2432 (7.9MP) 3648 x 2048 (7.5MP) 2432 x 2432 (5.9MP) Small 1/ Small (RAW) 2736 x 1824 (5.0MP) 2432 x 1824 (4.4MP) 2736 x 1536 (4.2MP) 1824 x 1824 (3.3MP) Small 2 1920 x 1280 (2.5MP) 1696 x 1280 (2.2MP) 1920 x 1080 (2.1MP) 1280 x 1280 (1.6MP) Small 3 720 x 480 (350K pixels) 640 x 480 (310K pixels) 720 x 408 (290K pixels) 480 x 480 (230K pixels) Image Size Resolution Frames Per Second NTSC PAL Full HD 1920 x 1080 30, 24 fps 25 fps HD 1280 x 720 60 fps 50 fps SD 640 x 480 30 fps 25 fps","id_right":7585770,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":197207,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Canon Digital 6D EF 24-105mm F4 Kit\"@en-US Kit | Infocus Camera & Imaging\"@en-US","description_right":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tProduct Overview\n\n20.2MP Full-Frame CMOS Sensor\nIncludes Canon EF 24-105mm f/4.0L Lens\n3.0\" Clear View High Resolution LCD\nDIGIC 5+ Image Processor\nBuilt-In Wi-Fi and GPS Connectivity\nFull HD 1080p with Manual Controls\n11-Point AF with Center Cross-Type Point\n63-Zone