emington Barrel Length 5\" Overall Length 44\"/46\" Safety No Manual Capacity 1 Weight 7.25 lbs SPECIFICATIONS Action Semi-Auto (Direct Impingement) Caliber 30 Thompson Center (TC) Barrel Length 22\" 243 Win./24\" 50 Cal. Overall Length 28.5\" - 33\" Safety Grip Capacity 6 rd Weight 7.25 lbs","id_right":7339467,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":14872300,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Nikon Coolpix S800c\"@en \" Nikon S800c (White) 16-megapixel digital camera with 10X optical zoom and Wi-Fi® at Crutchfield.com \"@en","description_right":"\"16-megapixel digital camera with 10X optical zoom and Wi-Fi® (White)\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":288,"row":{"pair_id":"67985#8335334","label":0,"id_left":67985,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":13642110,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Cámara CANON EOS Rebel SL1 \"@es \"Cámara Alkomprar.com\"@es","description_left":"\"\n                            •  Mega Pixeles: 18 •  Pantalla LCD: 2.7\" •  Estabilizador de imagen•  Maletín•  SD 8GB                        \"@es ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Marca CANON Megapixeles 12.1 MP TAMAÑO DE PANTALLA 3 Pulgadas ESTABILIZADOR DE IMAGEN Sí DETECTOR DE ROSTROS Sí DETECTOR DE SONRISAS Sí COLOR Negro","id_right":8335334,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":469403,"brand_right":"\"Canon\"@en, \"Null\"@en","title_right":" \"Canon EOS Rebel T3i (Body Only)\"@en Specs - CNET\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":289,"row":{"pair_id":"8278060#12734851","label":0,"id_left":8278060,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":362854,"brand_left":"\"Transcend\"@en-US","title_left":" \"Transcend 32GB CompactFlash Memory Card 133x (TS32GCF133)\"@en-US \"Accessories - Page 1531 | EISF\"@en-US","description_left":"\"Transcend's 133X CompactFlash cards offer the perfect combination of speed, capacity, and reliability. To ensure ultimate compatibility and speed, Transcend's 133X cards operate in both dual-channel and Ultra DMA mode 4, making consecutive shooting and non-stop video recording easier than ever. Impressive transfer speeds and enormous capacities up to 32GB ensure you get the very best results from your high-tech digital equipment.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12734851,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":5837496,"brand_right":"\"SanDisk\"@en-US","title_right":" \"Sandisk Extreme CompactFlash Memory Card - 64 GB (SDCFXS-064G-A46)\"@en-US \"Accessories Page 2271 | EISF\"@en-US","description_right":"\"The optimal combination of shot speed (up to 60MB/s), sustained video performance guarantee (VPG-20), and transfer speed (up to 120MB/s; 16GB - 128GB cards only.) ideal for use with mid-range to high-end DSLR cameras and HD camcorders, the SanDisk extreme CompactFlash memory card delivers first-rate read/write speeds to catch fast action shots and enable quick file transfers. This memory card features video performance guarantee (VPG-20) to deliver a minimum sustained recording data rate of 20MB/s to support high-quality full HD video (1080P) recording. Take advantage of burst-mode photography with the card's write speeds of up to 60MB/s (400X) and enjoy efficient workflow with its transfer speeds up to 120MB/s (16GB - 128GB cards only). with capacities up to 128GB, this memory card provides plenty of storage for full HD videos and RAW photos.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":290,"row":{"pair_id":"14811315#15838615","label":0,"id_left":14811315,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":571588,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Canon EOS BG-E14 Batterij Grip 70D/80D - Prijzen \"@NL Tweakers\"@NL","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Categorie Camera-accessoires Merk Canon Productser